{"id":"flxdy9k4wf52rll3caosiam19","title":"韩国监管机构将保护首次发现黑客攻击的交易所冻结资金","originalTitle":"South Korean Regulator Will Shield Exchanges That Freeze Funds at the First Sign of a Hack","summary":"韩国金融监管委员会（FSC）发布无行动信函，允许加密交易所首次发现黑客攻击时冻结用户资金。该政策要求交易所持续监控、将80%以上用户资产存于冷钱包，并需持有足额保险和储备金。Binance因黑客攻击损失6.3亿美元的热钱包资产，被视为政策制定参考案例。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Unchained"},"links":{"original":"https://unchainedcrypto.com/south-korean-regulator-will-shield-exchanges-that-freeze-funds-at-the-first-sign-of-a-hack/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:48:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T18:08:06.741Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T18:08:06.741Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布","SEC"],"score":66,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Unchained","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"sec","name":"SEC / 美国证监会"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}